375	   * PARENT — the integer part — not of the decimals. That is what keeps the
376	   * decimals a fixed PROPORTION of the figure at every size: a role passed as
377	   * `smallDecimalsComponent` carries its own absolute font size (LabelText is a
378	   * flat 12px), which would read correctly beside 23px integers and far too
