1153	 * ds-spinner-dash: the flat arc's Material dash cycle. The stops are
1154	 *   Material's own, rescaled from its 44-unit circle (circumference ≈ 126.9):
1155	 *   dash 1 → 100 → 100 becomes grow 0 → 1 → 1 (min → max sweep), and offset
1156	 *   0 → −15 → −125 becomes tail 0 → 15/126.9 → 125/126.9 of a turn.
