1228	/* RollingDigitsText slot enter/exit. Deliberately ONE-SIDED: the missing half of
1229	 * each pair is taken from the element's own computed style, so the same four
1230	 * keyframes drive a digit wheel and a grouping comma — two different resting
1231	 * widths — without either width appearing here. Adding the other half would pin
1232	 * them to one element type and quietly break the other. */
