1246	/* UnderlineLinkText sweep. First half: hold the right edge and shrink to zero so
1247	 * the line exits to the right. At the midpoint the (now zero-width) line jumps
1248	 * its anchor to the left — imperceptible because there is nothing to see — then
1249	 * the second half grows it back from the left. The 0% frame anchors right while
1250	 * the resting style anchors left, but at full width both are identical, so the
1251	 * animation starts without a jump. */
