272	   *           property (not registered), so it never transitions: the end gaps
273	   *           appear / vanish at once, as in the static M3 form, while only
274	   *           the arc scalar animates.
275	   *   start = C·p + gap   → dashoffset −start
276	   *   len   = C·(1 − p) − 2·gap → dasharray "len C"
